  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CGIAR: Multilateral Contributions (Research Initiatives and Science Programs)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Australian Centre for International Agricultural Research (ACIAR) contributions through this modality enables funding of ambitious designated CGIAR initiatives and science programs that tackle cross-cutting issues in agricultural research for development across the globe. These initiatives and programs are crucial mechanisms of delivery due to the ever more complex issues facing agricultural research for development requiring an innovative approach to research. ACIAR recognises that while no single research institution working alone can address the critically important issues of global climate change, agriculture, and food security and rural poverty, investments through this modality is critical in addressing these issues.</narrative>
  </description>
